    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like a \"foggy feeling\" though. it feels like the foundation is just gone. i lived for the intellect, the progress, the being \"the one\" who knew things. now i'm just an old person with a bunch of useless facts and no path forward. there's no version of me that exists outside of that achievement. without it, i'm just taking up space.",
